                <tr><td>Single-country e-invoicing go-live project duration</td><td>6–12 months</td><td>Billentis "Riding the Tornado" 2026 (Bruno Koch) — implementation timeline benchmark</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Readiness effort per mandate (internal prep only, excl. ERP config)</td><td>270–430h per mandate per entity</td><td>Derived from Avalara/Billentis anchors above; consistent with implementation partner project benchmarks. Not a single published benchmark — treated as internal estimate.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Structured team (low end)</td><td>270–290h</td><td>Organised ownership, clear mandate lead, proactive partner coordination</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Reactive team (high end)</td><td>405–430h</td><td>Distributed ownership, coordination overhead, post-go-live exception management</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <p class="meth-section-head">ERP multipliers</p>
            <table class="meth-table">
              <thead><tr><th>ERP</th><th>Multiplier</th><th>Entity scaling (2nd entity+)</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>NetSuite / Dynamics 365 / Other</td><td>×1.0</td><td>+25% per entity — baseline, consistent with SAPinsider implementation patterns and industry standard</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Sage X3</td><td>×1.2 (estimated)</td><td>+30% per entity — directional estimate based on single-tenant architecture; no published benchmark. Higher UAT overhead for localised compliance patches vs. multi-tenant cloud ERPs</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Oracle Cloud ERP</td><td>×1.3 (estimated)</td><td>+50% per entity — directional estimate. Forrester ERP Solutions Landscape Q1 2026 cites higher configuration complexity for Oracle Fusion vs. lightweight cloud ERPs in regulatory compliance scenarios</td></tr>
                <tr><td>SAP S/4HANA</td><td>×1.5</td><td>+60% per entity — supported by SAPinsider S/4HANA Migration Benchmark 2025 and Forrester ERP Solutions Landscape Q1 2026 (higher "configuration complexity" rating)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Multi-ERP (2+ systems)</td><td>Avg multiplier ×1.135</td><td>+13.5% integration penalty — IDC 2025 "SaaS ERP Multi-Cloud Complexity" survey (12–15% integration and reconciliation penalty for heterogeneous ERP environments)</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <p class="meth-section-head">Hourly rates</p>
            <table class="meth-table">
              <thead><tr><th>Rate</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>€85/h</td><td>Lean finance team — <a href="https://www.roberthalf.com/be/en/insights/salary-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Robert Half 2026</a></td></tr>
                <tr><td>€100/h</td><td>Finance + Tax + ERP cross-functional — <a href="https://www.hays.com/salary-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hays 2026</a></td></tr>
                <tr><td>€120/h</td><td>Enterprise specialists — <a href="https://www.morganmckinley.com/salary-guides" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Morgan McKinley 2026</a></td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <p style="margin-top:4px">Rates are fully loaded (1,650 productive hours/year). ERP reconfiguration and technical testing excluded.</p>

            <p class="meth-section-head">Annual mandate burden</p>
            <p>Mandate readiness is recurring, not one-time. <a href="https://www.vertexinc.com/resources/resource-library/navigating-urgent-e-invoicing-mandates-december-2025-regulatory-alert" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vertex Regulatory Tracker (Jan 2026)</a> recorded 11 significant regulatory events across France, Poland, Belgium, Spain, Latvia, and Greece in Q4 2025 alone — new technical schemas, pilot launches, legal amendments, and enforcement date confirmations. For a 4–6 country EU footprint, this suggests 4–7+ significant events per year is a conservative floor, not a ceiling. Event types carry different effort weights: go-live events (~100% readiness effort), schema/format updates (~40%), legislative tuning (~20%). Annual estimate uses 2.5–3.5 full-mandate equivalents per year. Note: the Sovos and Billentis reports are cited as general sources for EU mandate complexity; neither report contains the specific per-company frequency figure.</p>

            <p class="meth-section-head">Penalty exposure</p>
