      <span class="eyebrow-light">Mandate status — April 2026</span>
      <h2>Six clocks. All running.<br>None synchronised.</h2>
      <p>Think of each EU mandate as a clock set to a different alarm time. Poland's went off in February. France rings in September. Germany's issuance alarm sounds in January 2027. They do not run at the same speed, they do not warn you in advance, and none of them wait for each other. Your readiness gap is the distance between where your organisation is today and where each clock says you need to be.</p>
