      <h2>Tell us your situation. Get back a frank read of your mandate gaps.</h2>
      <p>If you have French, Polish, or German entities and a deadline on your radar, send a short note. We will come back with a frank read of your readiness gap and what a sprint would cover - in writing, within 48 hours.</p>
